{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1224649-psychokinesis-merit","id":1224649,"title":"Psychokinesis merit","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-04T05:53:48-07:00","id":1224649,"title":"Psychokinesis merit","content":"I didn't find a generic CoD question thread to post this so I'm creating new topic. I'm preparing game with heavy use of supernatural merits and I can't quite figure out Psychokinesis.<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Why psychokinesis, if used, for attack is resisted by Resolve? Why not minus Defense?</li> <li>How creation of a size 1 amout of element looks like?</li> <li>If I understand correctly to if a charaxter has 5 dot version of merit he can create element out of nothing to attack it but is this a single action (creation+attack) or two separate actions (create then attack)?</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-04T06:24:33-07:00","id":1224663,"title":"","content":"Here's the general thread<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/864699-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-general-chronicles-world-of-darkness\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ld-of-darkness</a><br /> <br /> Sorry I couldn't answer your questions","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-04T06:39:50-07:00","id":1224667,"title":"","content":"Thanks. I'll copy-post there","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2637-qendi","name":"qendi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-04T12:47:12-07:00","id":1224786,"title":"","content":"Here's an open ended, specific question for the Psychokinesis Merit: What are some examples of forces to use besides the given examples?<br /> <br /> Listed examples:<ul><li>Pyrokinesis - manipulation of fire.</li> <li>Cryokinesis - manipulation of &quot;cold&quot;.</li> <li>Electrokinesis - manipulation of electricity.</li> </ul>For those, the merit makes sense enough. What about other forces?<ul><li>Radiation - this is a broad category, so maybe it should be restricted to particular wave-lengths?</li> <li>Gravity - how would this work with Size options?</li> <li>Resonance - the CofD setting has forces other than those discovered so far, but how would the various &quot;Resonance&quot; forces be used for attacks?</li> <li>Magnetism - this is fairly easy to conceptualize, though the ability to attack with it seems a bit woo.</li> <li>Strong/Weak Nuclear - This... is just going to get messy fast. <i>How</i> could it be more reasonably be used?</li> <li>Friction - Would this basically be &quot;anti-telekinesis&quot;, manifesting in ways that &quot;stop&quot; the affected target or area?</li> </ul>What are some examples you've used or thought up, and how are they applied?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-04T14:32:34-07:00","id":1224810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1224649-psychokinesis-merit?p=1224786#post1224786\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Radiation - this is a broad category, so maybe it should be restricted to particular wave-lengths?<br /> Gravity - how would this work with Size options?<br /> Magnetism - this is fairly easy to conceptualize, though the ability to attack with it seems a bit woo.<br /> Strong/Weak Nuclear - This... is just going to get messy fast. <i>How</i> could it be more reasonably be used?<br /> Friction - Would this basically be &quot;anti-telekinesis&quot;, manifesting in ways that &quot;stop&quot; the affected target or area?</div> </div> </div> </div>Without rewriting how it works Psychometry can only work for forces that can be physically manifested in some way. I actually find it work better for different types of materials than trying to fit in any type of forces other than the three mentioned in the text.<br /> I personally enjoy Sangrokinesis (Blood Psychokinesis) as a means for evil blood sorcerers to quickly apply magical circles in blood as well as recreating horror movie tropes with blood dripping through walls/ceilings/objects or behaving in other weird ways.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Resonance - the CofD setting has forces other than those discovered so far, but how would the various &quot;Resonance&quot; forces be used for attacks? </div> </div> </div>It's basically same as above, but I also wish to add that Resonance is not a force. It's kind of a flavour or a colour. It supposedly generates Essence, but I personally think that process needs to be stimulated (either by entities dependent on the Resonant Condition, or through places of power like Loci and Hallows; in those cases it's easier to change the Resonance than it is to change the strength or location of the Locus/Hallow, further implying Resonance is the flavour rather than the source of energy).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":11887,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","user":"Tessie","date":". 06-04-2018, 05:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-05T06:15:05-07:00","id":1224938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1224649-psychokinesis-merit?p=1224810#post1224810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Without rewriting how it works Psychometry can only work for forces that can be physically manifested in some way. I actually find it work better for different types of materials than trying to fit in any type of forces other than the three mentioned in the text.<br /> I personally enjoy Sangrokinesis (Blood Psychokinesis) as a means for evil blood sorcerers to quickly apply magical circles in blood as well as recreating horror movie tropes with blood dripping through walls/ceilings/objects or behaving in other weird ways.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well it <i>does</i> specify <u>force</u> as opposed to substance.<br /> <br /> Using materials is certainly one way, though that means at 5 dots you can essential create matter from nothing. Even at 3 dots, you can take a bottle of water (assuming Hydrokinesis) and increase its size. Since it doesn't specify a duration for any of these changes, one could just make arbitrarily more long-lasting material given a seed amount, and time. &quot;Forces&quot; tend to dissipate, and thus side-step the accumulation issue.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1224649-psychokinesis-merit?p=1224810#post1224810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's basically same as above, but I also wish to add that Resonance is not a force. It's kind of a flavour or a colour. It supposedly generates Essence, but I personally think that process needs to be stimulated (either by entities dependent on the Resonant Condition, or through places of power like Loci and Hallows; in those cases it's easier to change the Resonance than it is to change the strength or location of the Locus/Hallow, further implying Resonance is the flavour rather than the source of energy).</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, Colors are just different wavelengths of radiation (and flavors are just configurations of detectable materials), so that comparison still lends some support to manipulating Resonance as a force directly (assuming a Photokinetic can't just decide to blast people with microwaves).<br /> <br /> Besides, manipulating Resonance via Psychokinesis lets you employ the &quot;attack&quot; option to kill people with Kindness (Resonance). Somehow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-05T09:48:34-07:00","id":1224987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1224649-psychokinesis-merit?p=1224938#post1224938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well it <i>does</i> specify <u>force</u> as opposed to substance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which I acknowledged when I mentioned it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Using materials is certainly one way, though that means at 5 dots you can essential create matter from nothing. Even at 3 dots, you can take a bottle of water (assuming Hydrokinesis) and increase its size. Since it doesn't specify a duration for any of these changes, one could just make arbitrarily more long-lasting material given a seed amount, and time. &quot;Forces&quot; tend to dissipate, and thus side-step the accumulation issue. </div> </div> </div>Since it's already a hack of Psychokinesis, you could just hack it further and add a scene long duration (which I assume the Advanced version also has but never specifies) on any manifestations (reverting any Size changes and removing pure manifestations). If you wish to, any manifestations removed this way (as opposed to moving it with your successes) leaves marks behind (though not enough to be used as a basis for a new iteration of the same power). In the case of Sangrokinesis it could be dried blood staining the floor in the vague form of a circle where the blood sorcerer performed their dark deeds, or reddish-brown spots in the previously bleeding wallpaper.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Well, Colors are just different wavelengths of radiation (and flavors are just configurations of detectable materials), so that comparison still lends some support to manipulating Resonance as a force directly (assuming a Photokinetic can't just decide to blast people with microwaves).<br /> <br /> Besides, manipulating Resonance via Psychokinesis lets you employ the &quot;attack&quot; option to kill people with Kindness (Resonance). Somehow. </div> </div> </div>You still can't do anything with Resonance (other than change it to another Resonance) because it works more like the chromophore of a molecule (the part being responsible for what wavelengths of light is reflected) rather than the photons that reflects off it. Photons are the Essence/Mana in this analogue; the energy that is flavoured by the chromophore/Resonance. The spirit doesn't absorb the Resonance. It absorbs the Essence/light that is flavoured by the Resonance/chromophore.<br /> In short: The Resonance is not a force because it's a quality that affects an actual force (Essence/Mana). You'd need to have Psychokinesis for Essence or something similar instead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-05T10:01:25-07:00","id":1224994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1224649-psychokinesis-merit?p=1224938#post1224938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well it <i>does</i> specify <u>force</u> as opposed to substance.<br /> <br /> Using materials is certainly one way, though that means at 5 dots you can essential create matter from nothing. Even at 3 dots, you can take a bottle of water (assuming Hydrokinesis) and increase its size. Since it doesn't specify a duration for any of these changes, one could just make arbitrarily more long-lasting material given a seed amount, and time. &quot;Forces&quot; tend to dissipate, and thus side-step the accumulation issue.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Well, Colors are just different wavelengths of radiation (and flavors are just configurations of detectable materials), so that comparison still lends some support to manipulating Resonance as a force directly (assuming a Photokinetic can't just decide to blast people with microwaves).<br /> <br /> Besides, manipulating Resonance via Psychokinesis lets you employ the &quot;attack&quot; option to kill people with Kindness (Resonance). Somehow.</div> </div> </div> </div>As apposed to the completely scientifically plausible creating energy from nothing. Its not like giving your players the ability to make a room full of water is going to destroy the game world. The way the resource merit works means that it really isn't hard to get their hands on most mundane materials, so object accumulation really isn't an issue unless you let them have a weird object focus our in very niche situations.<br /> <br /> It certainly isn't meant to be used for non-&quot;forces&quot;, but it can certainly work for them. If it bothered you you could make up an excuse for where the material comes form. &quot;Your Hydrokinises takes water from the air instead of making new water&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18090-ruger","name":"Ruger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar18090_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}